# Cursor: un-ignore local AI workspace even though `.ai/` is in `.gitignore`
# (keeps GitHub clean while allowing Agent / indexing / @ references).
# Docs: https://cursor.com/docs/reference/ignore-file
!.ai/
!.ai/**

# Heavy / generated paths - keep out of AI context (performance)
Env/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
Code/frontend/dist/
Code/backend/.data/
Code/backend/.pytest_tmp/
Test/.pytest-*/
**/*.pyc
